/research/umls/rxnorm</code></td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">  312914</td><td>secobarbital sodium 100 MG Oral Capsule</td></tr><tr><td><a name=\"barbiturate-medications-http://www.nlm.nih.gov/research/umls/rxnorm-315201\"> </a><code>http://www.nlm.nih.gov/research/umls/rxnorm</code></td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">  315201</td><td>secobarbital 50 MG Oral Capsule</td></tr></table></div>"
